      "content": "hey, i need some help writing a formal letter to my local school board. there's this new sexuality education curriculum they're trying to push on the kids and i think it's way out of line. i want to argue that parents should have the final say in what their kids are taught about these sensitive stuff instead of the school deciding for them. can u help me draft something that sounds professional but firm? thanks",
